ind":"announcement","title":"Gomoklear is at Steam Next Fest","summary":"Hey players — Gomoklear is part of Steam Next Fest! Come try the Demo.The Demo already includes a full Run: Matches, Serendipity, the Stall, Famous Matches, through to the Final Match.Play four sharply different ways to do Gomoku — Playstyles Overgrowth, Breakthrough, Encore, and High Cloud:Overgrowth: flood the board with spawned pieces and win by numbersBreakthrough: remove enemy pieces and stop their fivesEncore: extra turns — place more piecesHigh Cloud: move pieces and connect freelyMake fi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:15:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691667","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4834910-1846018067934035","game_id":"steam-4834910","kind":"update","title":"Demo v0.6 Update","summary":"Hey players — the Gomoklear Demo is now on v0.6!This update brings a fresh way to play: the High Cloud Playstyle. Pieces you move gain Gomoku Line Count equal to how far they traveled that Round.Run difficulty also opens up to level 5.What's new:New Playstyle High Cloud: unlocks after playing Encore. Move pieces to boost Gomoku Line Count.Blue move pieces: Cycle, Crowbar, Trebuchet, Elevator, Meteor, Aquarius, Earth, and more are now in the pool.New Manuscripts: Gust, Breaker, Twister.Difficulty","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T16:53:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067934035","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4834910-1841579228669731","game_id":"steam-4834910","kind":"update","title":"Demo v0.4 Update","summary":"Hey players — the Gomoklear Demo is now on v0.4!This update is a big step. What used to stop halfway through a two-Act Run is now a full three-Act campaign. At last, the Demo lets you feel a complete run and its pacing! :)We've also added a brand-new Playstyle: Encore. It lets you gain extra Turns to play pieces, and remakes Gomoku even more thoroughly. Trust me — it's addictive.White pieces have more company too, giving you more ways to gain extra Turns in a Match.On a Run you may also meet a m","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-21T18:28:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228669731","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4834910-1840944183775687","game_id":"steam-4834910","kind":"update","title":"Demo v0.3 Update","summary":"Hey players — the Gomoklear Demo is now on v0.3!What's new:UI refresh: match and menu visuals fully redrawn. Under a unified Eastern wood interface, the board feels brand new.Tutorial: a detailed Tutorial you can open anytime during a run.Content: newly unlocked pieces, plus the Serendipity Stargazing; Famous Matches now include the Greed Rival, who gains extra Turns as the Turn sequence goes on.The Demo will keep updating. If you like it, please wishlist or download and play it! Bugs or ideas? ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-13T04:18:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183775687","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4834910-1840310314346919","game_id":"steam-4834910","kind":"update","title":"Demo v0.2 Update","summary":"Hey players — the Gomoklear Demo just got an update!What's new:Controller support: play matches and navigate menus fully with a gamepad.Controls help: there's a controls button on the right side of the match screen — open it for keyboard and gamepad prompts.Game content: tweaked Playstyle unlock order and starting Libraries.Run into a bug, have feedback, or want to help test? Hop into our Discord anytime!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-08T06:15:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314346919","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4834910-1840310314338364","game_id":"steam-4834910","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Now Available","summary":"The Gomoklear Demo is now available!Play DemoConnect five. Clear the line. Break the board—familiar Gomoku (five in a row), rebuilt as a roguelike where every move can reshape the board.Within the Round Limit, rack up multiple five-in-a-rows—or go for six, seven, and beyond!What's in the Demo right now: A short two-Act run: Matches, Serendipity, the Stall, and Famous Matches with different rules.A new Gomoku rhythm: asymmetric Rounds. You act twice; your Rival acts once.Powered pieces and builds","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-05T06:37:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314338364","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4834910":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:31:39Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:31:39Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4834910":"2026-10-26T14:31:39Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4834910":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:31:39Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:31:39Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:31:39Z"},"5005320":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:31:39Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:31:39Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:31:39Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4834910","app_id":4834910,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:00Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"3f1b7b4b314fe81c13ca5b7f03995848a5acc985171afc2a46d2a0d403793137","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"『오목파국』은 「오련 즉 소거」의 오목 전략 로그라이크입니다. 선수 우위·수비 우선의 전통 오목이 아닙니다: 오련이 성립하면 기물은 판을 떠나고; 새 기물이 착수되어 생성·소거되며, 이동·변환으로 판은 끊임없이 재구성됩니다. 이능 기물과 비보를 모아, 기연과 노점에서 기고를 구축하세요. 라운드마다 당신은 2수, 적수는 1수. 수단이 다른 적수와 대국합니다. 오목은 이렇게 예측 불가능했던 적이 없습니다.","publishers":[{"name":"Bunny Dryer","creator_clan_account_id":46247573}],"developers":[{"name":"Bunny Dryer","creator_clan_account_id":46247573}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1801382400,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_month"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"trailer01_ko","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1787176080","trailer_category":3,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4834910/1167896882/a301b8c77d1a9681cb78747f42435731cdf517ad/1787175667/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"4834910/1167896882/a301b8c77d1a9681cb78747f42435731cdf517ad/1787175667/microtrailer.mp4","type":"video/mp4"}],"adaptive_trailers":[{"cdn_path":"4834910/1167896882/a301b8c77d1a9681cb78747f42435731cdf517ad/1787175667/dash_av1.mpd","encoding":"dash_av1"},{"cdn_path":"4834910/1167896882/a301b8c77d1a9681cb78747f42435731cdf517ad/1787175667/dash_h264.mpd","encoding":"dash_h264"},{"cdn_path":"4834910/1167896882/a301b8c77d1a9681cb78747f42435731cdf517ad/1787175667/hls_264_master.m3u8","encoding":"hls_h264"}],"screenshot_medium":"257403546/0437a1c672f04aece8c0d10d0a6395655b5d1e2d/movie_600x337.jpg","screenshot_full":"257403546/0437a1c672f04aece8c0d10d0a639565